	(text "\"Canyon\" routing for 800 ohm zone requires 800 ohm 0.2mm traces on L1.\nLayers 2,3,4 are empty and keep a 1.2mm clearance from L1 signals.\nL5 is gnd plane.\nL6 may be used for other signals (logic, etc.)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.24 36.83 0)
